BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annual Thanksgiving Dinner
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
DTSTAMP:20261115T173259Z
UID:054ac5166ed8db2ba06261503682@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:November 15th\, 2:00pm – 5:00pm. WDS Annual Thanksgiving Din
 ner A beloved annual tradition returns: an intimate journey through centur
 ies of American culinary heritage\, from the landmark houses to a family-s
 tyle feast in the Webb Barn\, in support of preservation that keeps this h
 istory alive. Come share a table\, a toast\, and a tradition at our annual
